    "## 5. Stage 2 Mock Configuration\n",
    "\n",
    "### Test Visitor Mock Setup\n",
    "```python\n",
    "    # Mock test visitor and summarizer\n",
    "    mock_visitor = Mock()\n",
    "    mock_test = Mock()\n",
    "    mock_test.name = \"test_function\"\n",
    "    mock_test.target_function = \"function\"\n",
    "    mock_test.inputs = []\n",
    "    mock_test.assertions = [\"assert True\"]\n",
    "    mock_visitor.tests = [mock_test]\n",
    "    mock_visitor_class.return_value = mock_visitor\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Test Visitor Mock Analysis:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Mock Test Object Design\n",
    "```python\n",
    "mock_test = Mock()\n",
    "mock_test.name = \"test_function\"\n",
    "mock_test.target_function = \"function\"\n",
    "mock_test.inputs = []\n",
    "mock_test.assertions = [\"assert True\"]\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Test Structure Attributes:**\n",
    "- **`name`**: Test function identifier\n",
    "- **`target_function`**: Function being tested\n",
    "- **`inputs`**: Test parameters and data\n",
    "- **`assertions`**: Validation statements\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Visitor Collection Mock\n",
    "```python\n",
    "mock_visitor.tests = [mock_test]\n",
    "mock_visitor_class.return_value = mock_visitor\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Pattern**: Visitor returns collection of parsed tests\n",
    "- **Collection interface**: `tests` attribute contains list\n",
    "- **Constructor mock**: `mock_visitor_class` creates instance\n",
    "- **Realistic data**: Mock matches expected test structure"
