    "        pytest.fail(f\"Stage 2 should handle IndentationError gracefully, but got: {e}\")\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Error Handling Validation Strategy:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Exception Prevention\n",
    "```python\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    result = orchestrator._stage2_scaffold_to_requirements(temp_workspace)\n",
    "    assert result == True\n",
    "except IndentationError as e:\n",
    "    pytest.fail(f\"Stage 2 should handle IndentationError gracefully, but got: {e}\")\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key Principle**: Stage 2 should handle parsing errors internally\n",
    "- **No exception propagation**: `IndentationError` caught and handled\n",
    "- **Success despite errors**: Stage continues with recoverable data\n",
