    "## 11. Key Testing Patterns Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "### Stage 1 Mocking Patterns\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 1. Hierarchical Mock Structure\n",
    "```python\n",
    "@patch('asabaal_utils.agents.spec_coder.orchestrator.CodeGenerator')\n",
    "def test_stage1_spec_to_scaffold(self, mock_generator_class):\n",
    "    mock_generator = Mock()\n",
    "    mock_result = Mock()\n",
    "    mock_result.success = True\n",
    "    mock_result.files_generated = [\"test_file.py\"]\n",
    "    mock_generator.generate_from_spec.return_value = mock_result\n",
    "    mock_generator_class.return_value = mock_generator\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Benefits:**\n",
    "- **Complete isolation**: Real AI model never called\n",
    "- **Controlled output**: Predictable test results\n",
    "- **Performance**: Fast execution without AI calls\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 2. Result Object Design\n",
    "```python\n",
    "mock_result.success = True\n",
    "mock_result.files_generated = [\"test_file.py\", \"another_file.py\"]\n",
    "mock_result.errors = []\n",
    "mock_result.warnings = []\n",
    "mock_result.execution_time = 5.0\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Benefits:**\n",
    "- **Realistic interface**: Matches actual generator output\n",
    "- **Comprehensive data**: All relevant attributes mocked\n",
    "- **Test validation**: Output can be verified in reports\n",
    "\n",
    "### Stage 2 Mocking Patterns\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 3. Dual Component Mocking\n",
    "```python\n",
