    "## 12. Strategic Insights & Best Practices\n",
    "\n",
    "### Mocking Strategy Philosophy\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 1. **Patch Where Used, Not Where Defined**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "@patch('asabaal_utils.agents.spec_coder.orchestrator.CodeGenerator')\n",
    "# NOT: @patch('asabaal_utils.agents.spec_coder.generator.CodeGenerator')\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key Principle**: Mock the import location, not the definition location\n",
    "- **Runtime replacement**: Mocks replace imported references\n",
    "- **Import path accuracy**: Use actual import location in test target\n",
    "- **Isolation guarantee**: Real code never executed\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 2. **Hierarchical Mock Design**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "mock_generator_class  # Constructor mock\n",
    "    └── mock_generator  # Instance mock\n",
    "        └── mock_result  # Return value mock\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Benefits:**\n",
    "- **Complete control**: Every level of interaction mocked\n",
    "- **Realistic behavior**: Mimics actual object creation\n",
    "- **Flexible testing**: Can test different scenarios at each level\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 3. **Realistic Mock Data**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "mock_result.files_generated = [\"test_file.py\", \"another_file.py\"]\n",
    "mock_result.execution_time = 5.0\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Benefits:**\n",
    "- **Production alignment**: Mock data matches real output\n",
    "- **Downstream testing**: Mock data flows to later stages\n",
    "- **Validation support**: Can verify mock data in reports\n",
    "\n",
    "### Error Handling Philosophy\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 4. **Prevent Exception Propagation**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    result = orchestrator._stage2_scaffold_to_requirements(temp_workspace)\n",
    "    assert result == True\n",
    "except IndentationError as e:\n",
    "    pytest.fail(f\"Should handle gracefully: {e}\")\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key Principle**: Components should handle errors internally\n",
    "- **Graceful degradation**: Continue processing despite errors\n",
    "- **User experience**: Don't expose internal parsing errors\n",
    "- **Pipeline stability**: One stage failure doesn't crash entire pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 5. **Test Realistic Error Scenarios**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "test_file1.write_text(''' pytest test code only.\n",
    "\n",
    "import pytest\n",
    "def test_function():\n",
    "    assert True''')\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Benefits:**\n",
    "- **Real-world errors**: Test actual AI generation artifacts\n",
    "- **Production readiness**: Handles common issues\n",
    "- **Robustness verification**: Ensures error handling works\n",
    "\n",
    "### State Management Philosophy\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 6. **Metadata Persistence Testing**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "assert orchestrator.spec_file_path == sample_openspec\n",
    "metadata = json.loads(metadata_file.read_text())\n",
    "assert metadata[\"stage_completed\"] == \"stage1\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Benefits:**\n",
    "- **State verification**: Test both object state and file state\n",
    "- **Cross-stage coordination**: Verify data flows between stages\n",
    "- **Audit trail**: Metadata provides execution history"
